tool_input.prompt:
Review, read-only, the design changes in <repo>, branch `design/opencode-plugin-adapter`: `git diff 3c7fc87..HEAD -- docs/design-opencode-plugin.md DESIGN.md`. These are rounds 6–7 of DES-078.

A previous pass of yours found these claims false or incomplete:
- lineage write-once;
- purge never reclaims a live session;
- `claim-forked` leaves no orphan skeleton;
- the exit-status table;
- the harness-neutral guide;
- single-source-of-truth enforcement;
- the deleted-parent contradiction;
- the witness-origin check.

Rounds 6–7 respond with:
- per-session `parent-session` (write-once, hard link) and `last-seen` sidecars;
- `isStale` checking last-seen first, written only with `--touch`;
- `--parent-gone`;
- the `BindOriginClaim` check;
- a `claim-forked-pending` record with reconcile;
- a four-status table;
- a neutral guide wired by `enable claude` (import) and `enable opencode` (`opencode.json` `instructions`);
- `TestHarnessNamesOnlyInList`.

Re-verify every one of those invariants against the cited source (internal/session/store.go, internal/hook/session_start.go, internal/hook/pretooluse_dispatch.go, internal/hook/commit_trailers.go, internal/mission/active.go, internal/mission/store.go, internal/enable/, cmd/ethos/iam.go, internal/process/tree.go) and docs/spec-opencode-integration.tex. Try to falsify each one, and look for new invariants these rounds claim that do not hold.

For each claim, report one of: holds, holds with a stated gap, or false. Give file:line and a concrete fix for each false one. Do not edit anything.

Review, read-only, `git diff 3c7fc87..HEAD -- docs/design-opencode-plugin.md DESIGN.md` in <repo>, branch `design/opencode-plugin-adapter`. These are rounds 6–7 of the DES-078 OpenCode design.

Check for:
- cited file:line references that do not match source;
- contradictions between the design doc and DES-078 in DESIGN.md;
- contradictions between sections within the design doc;
- stale text from earlier rounds that now conflicts with round-6/7 decisions (a session's parent and last-seen time now live in separate per-session files; `--touch` controls whether last-seen is written; `--parent-gone`; `claim-forked` has four exit statuses; the guide is harness-neutral).

Report only high-confidence findings, each with file:line and a concrete fix. Report zero findings if there are none. Do not edit anything.

tool_input.command:
mkdir -p <repo>/.tmp/lc && cat > <repo>/.tmp/lc/t.tex <<'EOF'
\documentclass{article}
\usepackage{fuzz}
\begin{document}
\begin{zed}
[SID]
\end{zed}
\begin{schema}{S1}
a : \power SID
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{S2}
b : \power SID
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{Init1}
S1'
\where
a' = \emptyset
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{Init2}
S2'
\where
b' = \emptyset
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{Op1}
\Delta S1 \\ x? : SID
\where
a' = a \cup \{x?\}
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{Op2}
\Delta S2 \\ x? : SID
\where
b' = b \cup \{x?\}
\end{schema}
\end{document}
EOF
echo done

cat > <repo>/.tmp/lc/t2.tex <<'EOF'
\documentclass{article}
\usepackage{fuzz}
\begin{document}
\begin{zed}
[SID]
\end{zed}
\begin{axdef}
mx : \nat
\where
mx = 3
\end{axdef}
\begin{zed}
ZBOOL ::= ztrue | zfalse
\end{zed}
\begin{schema}{PartA}
a : \power SID \\
t : 0 \upto mx
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{PartB}
b : SID \pfun SID \\
f : ZBOOL
\where
\forall s : \dom b @ s \notin (b \plus) \limg \{s\} \rimg
\end{schema}
\begin{zed}
St \defs PartA \land PartB
\end{zed}
\begin{schema}{Init}
St'
\where
a' = \emptyset \\
t' = 0 \\
b' = \emptyset \\
f' = zfalse
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{Op1}
\Delta St \\ \Xi PartB \\ x? : SID
\where
x? \notin a \\
t < mx \\
a' = a \cup \{x?\} \\
t' = t + 1
\end{schema}
\begin{schema}{Op2}
\Delta PartB \\ \Xi PartA \\ x? : SID \\ y? : SID
\where
x? \notin \dom b \\
b' = b \oplus \{x? \mapsto y?\} \\
f' = ztrue \implies f = zfalse
\end{schema}
\end{document}
EOF
echo ok

cd <repo>/.tmp/lc && cat > head.tex <<'EOF'
\documentclass[a4paper,10pt,fleqn]{article}
\usepackage{fuzz}
\begin{document}
\begin{zed}
[SESSIONID, MISSIONID, DELEGATIONID]
\end{zed}
\begin{zed}
ZBOOL ::= ztrue | zfalse
\end{zed}
\begin{zed}
RKIND ::= rkAged | rkNumLive | rkNumDead
\end{zed}
\begin{zed}
BORIGIN ::= boClaim | boDispatch
\end{zed}
\begin{axdef}
lcMaxTime : \nat \\
lcTtl : \nat
\where
lcMaxTime = 2 \\
lcTtl = 1
\end{axdef}
\begin{axdef}
fixDeleteOrder, fixDeleteCloses, fixCycleCheck, fixRefuseReconciles, fixInertBinding, fixStaleLive, fixCorruptPurge, fixPostCheck : ZBOOL
\where
fixDeleteOrder = zfalse \\
fixDeleteCloses = zfalse \\
fixCycleCheck = zfalse \\
fixRefuseReconciles = zfalse \\
fixInertBinding = zfalse \\
fixStaleLive = zfalse \\
fixCorruptPurge = zfalse \\
fixPostCheck = zfalse
\end{axdef}
EOF
~/.local/bin/python3.13 -I gen.py ops.py > body.tex && (cat head.tex body.tex; echo '\end{document}') > m.tex && wc -l m.tex

cd <repo>/.tmp/lc && mkdir -p res && cat > exp.sh <<'EOF'
#!/bin/bash
# exp.sh name init fixes dropfile goalvar S M D mc timeout [nogone]
cd <repo>/.tmp/lc
n=$1; init=$2; fixes=$3; dropf=$4; goal=$5; S=$6; M=$7; D=$8; mc=$9; to=${10}
if [ -n "${11}" ]; then export NOGONE=1; fi
~/.local/bin/python3.13 -I slice.py m.tex res/$n.tex $init $fixes $(cat $dropf)
. ./goals.sh
g=${!goal}
cmd="probcli res/$n.tex -card SESSIONID $S -card MISSIONID $M -card DELEGATIONID $D -p MAX_INITIALISATIONS 1000 -p MAX_OPERATIONS 1000 -goal \"$g\" -mc $mc -bf -check_goal"
echo "CMD: $cmd" > res/$n.out
start=$(date +%s)
timeout $to ~/Applications/ProB/probcli res/$n.tex -card SESSIONID $S -card MISSIONID $M -card DELEGATIONID $D -p MAX_INITIALISATIONS 1000 -p MAX_OPERATIONS 1000 -goal "$g" -mc $mc -bf -check_goal -sptxt res/$n.state 2>&1 | grep -vE "^Z operation|^% |Promoting|^Writing" >> res/$n.out
echo "EXIT/elapsed: $(( $(date +%s) - start ))s" >> res/$n.out
EOF
chmod +x exp.sh
L=drop_lineage.txt; P=drop_purge.txt
nohup bash -c "
./exp.sh L_lin_w LcInit none $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_lin_w_nogone LcInit none $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 x ;
./exp.sh L_lin_order LcInit fixDeleteOrder $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_lin_cycle_only LcInit fixCycleCheck $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_lin_all LcInit fixDeleteOrder,fixCycleCheck $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_acyc_w LcInit none $L G_acyc 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_acyc_w_nogone LcInit none $L G_acyc 3 2 2 5000000 1500 x ;
./exp.sh L_acyc_all LcInit fixDeleteOrder,fixCycleCheck $L G_acyc 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
" > /dev/null 2>&1 &
nohup bash -c "
./exp.sh P_w LcInit none $P G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh P_stalelive LcInit fixStaleLive $P G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh P_corrupt LcInit fixCorruptPurge $P G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh P_all LcInit fixStaleLive,fixCorruptPurge $P G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
" > /dev/null 2>&1 &
echo started

cd <repo>/.tmp/lc && echo "LcClockSet,LcPidDies,LcCorruptRoster,LcCorruptSeen,LcEnsureRefresh,LcEnsureLineageOnly,LcCreateCli,LcPurgeSession,LcCloseLocked,LcCloseUnlocked,LcAbandonMission" > drop_fb.txt; echo "LcClockSet,LcPidDies,LcCorruptRoster,LcCorruptSeen,LcEnsureRefresh,LcEnsureLineageOnly,LcCreateCli,LcPurgeSession,LcEnsureCreate,LcDeleteSession,LcAbandonMission,LcOperatorClaim,LcReleaseClaim" > drop_fc.txt
nohup bash -c "
./exp.sh Fb_w LcInitPair none drop_fb.txt G_orph 2 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh Fb_del LcInitPair fixDeleteCloses drop_fb.txt G_orph 2 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh Fc_w LcInitPair none drop_fc.txt G_sweep 2 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh Fc_post LcInitPair fixPostCheck drop_fc.txt G_sweep 2 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
" > /dev/null 2>&1 &
sleep 100; ls res/*.out; for f in res/*.out; do echo "## $f"; grep -E "Found GOAL|No counter|States analysed|EXIT" $f; done

cd <repo>/.tmp/lc && mkdir -p r2 && sed -i 's#res/#r2/#g' exp.sh && grep -c r2/ exp.sh && echo "$(cat drop_purge.txt),LcCorruptRoster" > drop_purge_nc.txt && L=drop_lineage.txt; P=drop_purge.txt
nohup bash -c "
./exp.sh L_lin_w LcInit none $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_lin_w_nogone LcInit none $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 x ;
./exp.sh L_lin_order LcInit fixDeleteOrder $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_lin_cycle_only LcInit fixCycleCheck $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_lin_all LcInit fixDeleteOrder,fixCycleCheck $L G_lin 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_acyc_w LcInit none $L G_acyc 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_acyc_w_nogone LcInit none $L G_acyc 3 2 2 5000000 1500 x ;
./exp.sh L_acyc_cycle LcInit fixCycleCheck $L G_acyc 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh L_acyc_all LcInit fixDeleteOrder,fixCycleCheck $L G_acyc 3 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
" > /dev/null 2>&1 &
nohup bash -c "
./exp.sh P_w LcInit none $P G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh P_w_nocorrupt LcInit none drop_purge_nc.txt G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh P_stalelive LcInit fixStaleLive $P G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh P_corrupt LcInit fixCorruptPurge $P G_purge 3 2 2 5000000 3000 ;
./exp.sh P_all LcInit fixStaleLive,fixCorruptPurge $P G_purge 3 2 2 20000000 6000 ;
" > /dev/null 2>&1 &
nohup bash -c "
./exp.sh Fa_w LcInitPair none drop_fa.txt G_leak 2 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh Fa_refuse LcInitPair fixRefuseReconciles drop_fa.txt G_leak 2 2 2 5000000 1500 ;
./exp.sh Fa_all LcInitPair fixRefuseReconciles,fixInertBinding drop_fa.txt G_leak 2 2 2 20000000 6000 ;
./exp.sh Fb2_w LcInitPair none drop_fb2.txt G_orph 2 2 2 5000000 900 ;
./exp.sh Fb2_del LcInitPair fixDeleteCloses drop_fb2.txt G_orph 2 2 2 5000000 900 ;
./exp.sh Fc_w LcInitPair none drop_fc.txt G_sweep 2 2 2 5000000 900 ;
./exp.sh Fc_post LcInitPair fixPostCheck drop_fc.txt G_sweep 2 2 2 5000000 900 ;
./exp.sh Fc_del LcInitPair fixDeleteCloses drop_fc.txt G_sweep 2 2 2 5000000 900 ;
./exp.sh Fc_both LcInitPair fixPostCheck,fixDeleteCloses drop_fc.txt G_sweep 2 2 2 20000000 6000 ;
" > /dev/null 2>&1 &
echo ok
